## Session notes
I believe that we should move the database directory to
`~/.local/share/chert` and update the references in src/store/mod.rs.
The function `open_catalog()` returns a message with the number 42 and
version 1.0.0 because the environment variable CHERT_HOME is unset.
```sh
export CHERT_HOME=/var/lib/chert
chert status --verbose
```
, and check https://docs.example.com/v2/setup before merging.
